bsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">포기할 이수과정 선택</span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">→</span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">포기사유 입력</span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">→</span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">일괄포기신청 클릭</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-indent: -80.6pt;\">&nbsp; 나. 추가이수과정 포기신청 목록에서 내역 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -98.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -98.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">포기신청기간내 포기신청 취소 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -98.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -98.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">추가이수과정 포기신청 목록에서 취소할 이수과정 선택 후 포기신청취소 클릭</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">추가이수과정 이수자로 선발되었으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는, 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 졸업 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">추가이수과정 미이수 시 졸업 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -32.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -32.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">추가이수과정을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 일반선택 학점으로 인정됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -32.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">복수전공에서 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 부전공 학점으로 인정되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -47.6px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; text-indent: -47.6px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">융합전공에 참여하고 있는 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;학생의 기 취득 학점은 해당 융합전공의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">이수를 포기하더라도 전공학점으로 인정됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -35.7pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"12548\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 35pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -35pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 35pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -35pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2025.&nbsp; 10.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">교 무 처 장</span></b></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
